---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Jianfeng — principal software engineer at Uber.">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <div class="about-intro">
    <img
      class="avatar"
      src="/selfie.png"
      alt="Jianfeng"
      width="140"
      height="140"
    />
    <p>Hi, I'm Jianfeng — welcome to my blog.</p>
  </div>
  <p>
    I'm a principal software engineer at Uber, where I've worked across a range
    of projects — from our search and money platforms to shipping products like
    our auction and carrier portals. I studied computer science at UESTC, then
    Carnegie Mellon, then Stanford. My main interests are platform engineering, mathematics
    and applied cryptography.
  </p>
  <p>
  All articles and diagrams are hand-crafted instead using AI. These articles are mostly summerizing 
  my learning and thoughts. I will be very happy if you found it useful, too.
  </p>
  <p>
    Away from the keyboard, you'll find me playing tennis, snowboarding, or at
    the track for motorsports.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
